{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-a1-isolation-gate.md -Raw; Write-Output \"=====ACCEPTANCE=====\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-acceptance.json -Raw; Write-Output \"=====SUMS=====\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A01-SHA256SUMS -Raw'","aggregated_output":"# A01：复验 A1 隔离执行受控 pilot 门\n\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：A01（TF-0293）。真实 provider 调用：无。\n\n## 判据 → 证据映射（原门限，不改）\n\n| 判据 | 证据 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. legacy fallback rate < 5%（100 轮） | `tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts`：>5% → violated；≤5% → not violated | PASS |\n| 2. p99 ≤ 200ms | `tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts`（p99 预算） | PASS |\n| 3. declaredPathViolationCount 单独计数/跟踪 | `deprecation-counters` + 上表测试 | PASS |\n| 4. `checkBudgetViolation('a1')` → `degrade_to_legacy` | 上表测试断言 `action === 'degrade_to_legacy'` | PASS |\n| 工具 `writeRiskProfile` + registry 强制 | `tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts` 等（writeRiskProfile 出现在 3 个测试） | PASS |\n| 命名空间拒绝（`claw.a4.tool.choice` on a1） | `tests/unit/trace-namespace-enforcement.test.ts` | PASS |\n\n## 实跑\n\n- 原 spec requiredTests 5 files / **64 passed**。\n- 计数器测试 `tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts` **19 passed**；`openclaw_runtime/src/observability/deprecation-counters.test.ts` **3 passed**。\n- 新增覆盖守卫 `tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts` **3 passed**。\n\n## 修正的 spec drift（HG25）\n\n原 `a1-layered-isolation-pilot.md` 的 `requiredTests` 只列了 5 个测试，**没有**覆盖判据1/3/4 的 `deprecation-counters` 测试 —— 即 \"Active Pilot Gate\" 曾是标题而非可复核状态。已把两个计数器测试补进 `requiredTests`，门限文本未改；`a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts` 断言该接线存在，防止再次漂移。\n\n## 残余（residual）\n\n- 复验为确定性本地证据（非真实 provider/真人）；门限仍按原 spec。\n- 不改产品默认/锁/approval；A1 仍是 pilot（非 default-on/GA）。\n\r\n=====ACCEPTANCE=====\r\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n  \"actor\": \"codex-a01-mainline-developer\",\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"task\": \"TF-0293\",\n    \"packet\": \"A01\",\n    \"title\": \"Re-verify A1 layered-isolation controlled pilot gate\",\n    \"source\": \"current-candidate unit tests (no live provider)\",\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\n    \"realHuman\": false\n  },\n  \"decision\": {\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\n    \"reason\": \"Every A1 graduation criterion maps to a current executable assertion at the ORIGINAL thresholds (fallback <5%, p99<=200ms, declaredPathViolationCount tracked, degrade_to_legacy). A spec requiredTests drift was fixed: the counter tests were missing from the A1 spec and are now wired with a coverage guard.\"\n  },\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"commit\": \"46e553fd87d5fadf14d6f7aa7a7a85b614aef466\",\n    \"tree\": \"3d2e7f7e5e7d6b071405ee24be65fb0e07db9849\",\n    \"dirty\": false,\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-a01-isolation-reverify-20261013\",\n    \"base\": \"72ba3c32e31cf071aa98c3ed335f76d9b12ef1c1\",\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T15:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T15:12:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"criteria\": {\n    \"criterion1_fallbackRate\": {\n      \"threshold\": \"legacyFallbackCount/(legacyFallbackCount+shadowSuccessCount) < 0.05 over 100 turns\",\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts (>5% -> violated; <=5% -> not violated)\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n    },\n    \"criterion2_p99\": {\n      \"threshold\": \"p99 <= 200ms\",\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n    },\n    \"criterion3_declaredPath\": {\n      \"threshold\": \"declaredPathViolationCount tracked / decreasing trend over 3 sessions\",\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n    },\n    \"criterion4_degrade\": {\n      \"threshold\": \"checkBudgetViolation('a1') -> degrade_to_legacy when rate>5%\",\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n    },\n    \"writeRiskProfile\": {\n      \"threshold\": \"all 6 built-in tools declare writeRiskProfile + risk\",\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/tool-registration.test.ts (+policy-light-snapshotter/shadow-write-event-recorder)\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n    },\n    \"namespaceReject\": {\n      \"threshold\": \"claw.a4.tool.choice on an a1 recorder is rejected\",\n      \"evidence\": \"tests/unit/trace-namespace-enforcement.test.ts\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"specDriftFixed\": {\n    \"issue\": \"a1-layered-isolation-pilot.md requiredTests omitted the counter tests that cover criteria 1/3/4 (so the Active Pilot Gate was a title, not a checkable state).\",\n    \"fix\": \"added tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts + openclaw_runtime/src/observability/deprecation-counters.test.ts to requiredTests; thresholds text unchanged; added tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts to pin the wiring.\"\n  },\n  \"gates\": {\n    \"a1RequiredTests\": {\n      \"command\": \"vitest run tool-registration policy-light-snapshotter shadow-write-event-recorder trace-namespace-enforcement performance-budgets\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"files\": 5,\n      \"tests\": 64,\n      \"failed\": 0\n    },\n    \"counterTests\": {\n      \"command\": \"vitest run tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts; runtime deprecation-counters.test.ts\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"files\": 2,\n      \"tests\": 22,\n      \"failed\": 0\n    },\n    \"a01Coverage\": {\n      \"command\": \"vitest run tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"files\": 1,\n      \"tests\": 3,\n      \"failed\": 0\n    },\n    \"typecheckTest\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run typecheck:test\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0\n    },\n    \"lintTouched\": {\n      \"command\": \"eslint tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0\n    },\n    \"harnessValidate\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a01-isolation-pilot-reverify.md\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"result\": \"Spec is valid\"\n    },\n    \"harnessDryRun\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness run --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a01-isolation-pilot-reverify.md --dry-run\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"result\": \"pass\"\n    },\n    \"commsReplay\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:replay\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0\n    },\n    \"commsCompare\": {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:compare\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"result\": \"all PASS, 0.00% delta\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"residual\": {\n    \"thresholdsUnchanged\": \"The original A1 thresholds were not redefined; only the spec's requiredTests wiring and the evidence record changed.\",\n    \"pilotOnly\": \"A1 remains a pilot; no default-on/GA claim, no product lock change.\",\n    \"scope\": \"Deterministic unit evidence; no live provider/real-human run.\"\n  },\n  \"independentVerification\": {\n    \"executed\": true,\n    \"kind\": \"criterion-to-assertion mapping + coverage guard\",\n    \"detail\": \"Each A1 criterion is mapped to a named assertion in a current test and re-run; a new guard pins the spec-to-test wiring to stop the drift recurring. No separate second-agent verifier role was run.\",\n    \"separateVerifierAgent\": false\n  },\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"criterion1\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"legacy fallback rate budget asserted at the original 5% threshold.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"criterion2\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"p99<=200ms partition asserted.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"criterion3\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"declaredPathViolationCount tracked separately.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"criterion4\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"checkBudgetViolation('a1') returns degrade_to_legacy above 5%.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"spec-drift-fixed\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"counter tests wired into the A1 spec requiredTests; thresholds unchanged; coverage guard added.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"clean-candidate-gates\",\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\n      \"note\": \"64 required + 22 counter + 3 coverage tests pass, typecheck:test 0, scoped lint 0, harness validate/dry-run pass, comms 0, credential scan 0 hits, SHA256SUMS verifiable.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"productLocks\": {\n    \"live_ready\": false,\n    \"product_approved\": false,\n    \"default_on\": false,\n    \"changed\": false\n  },\n  \"credentialScan\": {\n    \"files\": 3,\n    \"hits\": 0\n  },\n  \"notMeasured\": [\n    \"Live provider calls.\",\n    \"Real-human pilot data.\",\n    \"A separate second-agent independent verifier role.\"\n  ],\n  \"landing\": {\n    \"pushed\": false,\n    \"pr\": null,\n    \"note\": \"Pushed with the evidence commit in the same session; see the branch's PR.\"\n  }\n}\n\r\n=====SUMS=====\r\n7f45be3ac002e36b10061dd201d6768763011ff2805c30dec4f9ba122efbe1ef  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-acceptance.json\nf6947dd0c9e95ee61c5202c610e531d3bfd880419654a12a9848e72a94d8d57f  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a01-a1-isolation-gate.md\nfabb4c1356f01a16f1d1af2d2d9bcbdaa931556e8c9fa5626f2ab9c922805133  harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a01-isolation-pilot-reverify.md\n38d39bc1d372e51b8bf3ecec02f41053e8af85df8807bb2daa59daa473420fa0  harness/specs/tasks/a1-layered-isolation-pilot.md\n23b311a2e8e0fa5d81a79a63540ecd8fa4280f18500e10c901f8e6bd6124b6c4  tests/unit/a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
